OL,3,GNEWSABA flight forced to turn back over
OL,4,Acracked window
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for British Airways said
OL,7,Fthe plane landed safely at Gatwick due
OL,8,Fto a "minor technical issue" and
OL,9,Fpassengers were due to resume their
OL,10,Fjourney.
